BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eight Step Recovery Group For Men
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260416T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260416T183000
UID:698e35d47a9abeb5b2a92fad@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Eight Step Recovery is an alternative recovery program to the 
 12-Step program of Alcoholic Anonymous. The program is a set of mindfulnes
 s teachings outlining a suggested course of action for recovery from addic
 tion\, stinking thinking\, negative mental states\, and compulsive and obs
 essive behaviours.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/eight-step-recovery-for-
 men-16-apr
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Class: Meditation & In-Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260416T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260416T211500
UID:13042badfaaa55706d29d6d5@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us in this lively exploration of the first teaching of th
 e Buddha - the Four Noble Truths: dukkha (suffering or unsatisfactoriness)
 \, samudaya (its origin)\, nirodha (the cessation of suffering)\, marga (t
 he path leading to the cessation of suffering)'
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/thurs-night-16-apr
END:VEVENT
